{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "3483f6571f7047fbaa5e6c774bbd359918bd91593febe4888880052f61470a53", "ja": "成長Chu→LOVER!!", "zh": "成長Chu→LOVER!!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "caa9e6e7e720e6cc48235edea89f52d0e92f39d824aec56fd75b9609a6b0aa02", "ja": "リフレッシュしたふたりは、ダブルリーダー\nとしてメンバーからの信頼を勝ち得てゆき、\nやがて公演当日を迎える。開幕が迫る中、百\n合子は杏奈へと、一緒にやる新曲の振り付け\nが大好きだと語り、心を通わせるのだった。", "zh": "重新打起精神的两人，以双队长的身分逐渐\n得到成员的信赖，接着迎来公演当天。\n就在快开幕的时候，百合子告诉杏奈，\n自己非常喜欢她们那首新歌的动作，\n拉近了彼此心与心的距离。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9950f788eac45c1a64d1d3bf5d4eecc4d09490b4e213b78fe086e9e3461475bb", "ja": "（休暇で十分リフレッシュできたのか、復帰した後の\n杏奈と百合子は、精力的にリーダーをつとめ……）", "zh": "（或许是在休假时获得了充分的休息，\n杏奈及百合子回到剧场后，积极地尽到队长的职责……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "29c057fc248746c8f178c1c4e1f67031b09352cd3fffb9461a0cb63bc34e95de", "ja": "（そして、地方公演当日を迎えた！\n直前のリハも完ぺきだったし、この調子なら……）", "zh": "（然后，到了地方公演当天！\n开场前的彩排也十分完美，照这个步调下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3ac9adc8d2a9769124b7a7b14156dd99fd07bc95e89e27c882645be2e8d01dc", "ja": "うう……歌い出し間違いませんように。歌い出し間違い\nませんように。歌い出し間違いませんように……！", "zh": "呜呜……希望一开始不要唱错、希望一开始不要唱错。\n希望一开始不要唱错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "de075ae9c19da63668858f004bdcd523f33e763b3ffe084f80100747443ba672", "ja": "（……大丈夫だろうか）", "zh": "（……真的没问题吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "5df7ec28310987232cc02d82f26b5db72f00f503c5d9154dc399d135a57ae173", "ja": "百合子さん……大丈夫？", "zh": "百合子……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "a5e2fafea374a20d80eea120249c27491305d4e1d808987081f781967c832e2c", "ja": "ご、ごめんね。さっきまで平気だったんだけど、\n今になって、またドキドキしてきちゃって……！", "zh": "抱、抱歉，我原本完全没问题的，\n但等到快要上场时，又开始紧张了起来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4ad9afffc1686c35c4564b8c2c6ab0058368445728a085eb288294639c0f4148", "ja": "とにかく、みんなは上手と下手に別れてスタンバイだ。\nリーダー二人はセンターだから、ここに残ってくれ。", "zh": "总而言之，大家先分别在舞台左右两侧待命。\n两位队长是Center，先留在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb686f5969303eb657cb2235c74c7634d78a91bb507deff49577f307f8792fd9", "ja": "百合子さん。リーダーは、どんなにきんちょうしてても\nぜんぜんへいき！って顔してたほうがいいんだって！", "zh": "百合子姊姊，听说队长无论心里多么紧张，\n都要摆出「完全没问题！」的表情比较好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "f86997787d7a0850f67eebd95582185967e86cc8b8d7e301d75ef08a962de242", "ja": "ううっ、育ちゃんのリーダー論はスパルタだなぁ。", "zh": "呜呜，小育的队长论也太斯巴达了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f2c2c4c1feeca83df70c70c968c59ac37e8e0b6d81114f22ddfbe2c66db58caf", "ja": "百合子さんなら、だいじょうぶ！\nそれじゃ、また後でね！", "zh": "百合子姊姊一定没问题的！\n那就待会儿见啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "388fab7a9a2ac164f95d932f0bf610c7412f1d160e47e5378b7364193f8e2fb6", "ja": "安心してください。直前のリハは完ぺきだった……と、\n{$P$}さんの顔に書いてありました！", "zh": "请放心，「开场前的彩排十分完美……」\n{$P$}先生的脸上是这么写的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "f8699280cfddd5033ab9f32ad328132601e6aaa477b507241f1a4257c71a7f9a", "ja": "じ、準備の時は、二人ががんばってくれたから……\n今日は私たちに、支えさせてね……♪", "zh": "准、准备的时候，你们都非常努力……\n所以今天，请让我们协助你们吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "9168e9a94144e11ef9da3576528c6a5b79a2e452265db78a9fee13916b3f2b68", "ja": "可憐さん、亜利沙も……。\nありがと……です♪", "zh": "可怜、亚利沙……\n谢谢……你们♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef3b0c8588ba09bc6e203c9a8e324a48cab3875f9eb78a7309fb9851a917c338", "ja": "公演のリーダーで、しかもトップバッターなんて。\n最高の立場ですよね。", "zh": "既是公演的队长，同时还要打头阵。\n这是最棒的位置了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "3221fe5ac1f1fc764e04a4a8c420476c84b8150d5fb97c80942a53a0c4f824d0", "ja": "でも……相応しいと思います。\n一緒にがんばりましょう、ダブルリーダー。", "zh": "不过……我觉得你们很适合这个位置。\n一起加油吧，两位队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "33d45ff8b977498a1da9a19da36868500bbcaaab0c7086144e4e163937354985", "ja": "志保も……ありがとう。\nうん、一緒に、最高のライブにしようね！", "zh": "志保……也谢谢你。\n嗯，我们一起打造一场最棒的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "376354049faa4ca4e28b663fba57382e47b46110edbf560f79606ae16c4d4b01", "ja": "どうだ、百合子。緊張は収まったか？", "zh": "怎么样，百合子？有比较不紧张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "73f12397bc5063cfe5a609fc5262b69df981b38e5601c7bb0165ac03f066b880", "ja": "は、はいっ。みんなが声をかけてくれたおかげで、\nなんとか……。", "zh": "是、是的，多亏有大家跟我说话，\n总算好一些了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "1028cd1c4fa3730111b54641a367d1435d2828628e5fabecdf2846bdb489a721", "ja": "でも、百合子さん……\nまだ……震えてる？", "zh": "可是，百合子……\n你还在……发抖耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "338ea0ffa1d4beb5f132aec816151d8d87d3b4c536e7018ec96571c8a6c4c55f", "ja": "う、うん、そうだねっ。\n……まだ、ちょっとだけ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，是啊。\n……还有，一点点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "e84d7c26431e35f2f2c2fc6af79c7fd8dfbcc600622a1db7c27317a28d8475c3", "ja": "んと。じゃあ……。", "zh": "嗯，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "a81e31a38826acf5a6c9c4b883d3a08e7a339f7b4e607bddb37974d28eb1da76", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。\n手、冷たいね。", "zh": "小杏……\n你的手很凉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "8de949e0054caad8bfffc03ecd2369e94391073905b2a2dadbb78a27d9404b8a", "ja": "ん。杏奈も、ドキドキ……してる。", "zh": "嗯，杏奈的心跳……也很快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "7479f0b57558e138e338e692eb47e4ed497ca8dcec1f68f958a06d70f91ba959", "ja": "……。\n私、頼りない相棒でごめんね。", "zh": "……\n抱歉，我是个不可靠的搭档。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "86c6f76fba31eb722187e41f164debf03ae033c0c325c9fb963a4c4d0938e72e", "ja": "すぐに逃げたくなっちゃうし、思い込みも激しいし、\nステージの前は、いまだに足が震えちゃうし……。", "zh": "我动不动就想逃避，也很会钻牛角尖，\n直到现在，上场前双脚都还会发抖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "823fe96bf20efa967ea16918540fb6f1be0d98d84cb791e6fb90e5af320515d1", "ja": "けど、杏奈ちゃんが私を引っ張ってくれて、ここまで\n連れてきてくれたから……。うん、頑張れそう！", "zh": "不过，是小杏一直拉着我，把我带到了这个地方……\n嗯，我觉得还能再加把劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "aa4729a81c357efeeb5634c9d0a012c265832c5bb85898da1a0adef7f9bdd9f2", "ja": "杏奈、引っ張ってない……。\nふたりで……来たの……。", "zh": "杏奈，没有拉着你……\n杏奈我们……是两个人一起来到这里的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "03b0702e07310f185abfc74c86dfa122d32b8c70c3fcc540dc49c6e377c63791", "ja": "あ。えへへっ、そうだよね。\n私たち、初めて同士……だもんね！", "zh": "啊，嘿嘿，说得也是。\n我们两个都是第一次……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "89f34baaeafa9c1d75824f63e0c3d2961c05d14c0953113400d5c3fd10875bde", "ja": "うん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "9302aa8870c9b648ef1fc223b0b5950fc0f663e015b2c3957ba2b84f469c6aaf", "ja": "あのね。私、今回の曲の、杏奈ちゃんと一緒に\nハートを作る振り付けが大好きなんだ。", "zh": "跟你说喔，在这次的歌曲中，\n我最喜欢的是跟小杏一起划出爱心的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "dfc32a3f7a07715be40f8e4ea1101970c00d8b8f83715443d403a27eaf1998e0", "ja": "今日は、この会場を丸ごと包み込めるような、\n大きなハートを作ろうね！", "zh": "今天我们一起做出一个，\n能够围住这个会场的大爱心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "79dcfc0c39df6753abcd86a2f90fe99afa713fac5b8c59e5217c59de3273bb75", "ja": "うん……杏奈、百合子さんとなら……作れる、よ。\nすごく大きな……杏奈たちの、ハート……♪", "zh": "嗯……杏奈，如果是跟百合子一起……做得出来喔。\n很大很大的……杏奈我们的爱心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b9b1d2c1cb848ff3aee168f10bf0dd7ae635b5c30f02386a1af1e7ef6786174b", "ja": "（たくさんの困難を、二人は力を合わせ、\n心を通わせることで、見事に乗り越えてくれた）", "zh": "（她们两个同心协力，\n成功克服了许多困难。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "98bebc54c622b884cb09e59904b486b150f274c510cf5013af80667df259c7cc", "ja": "（大きく育った二人のハートは、これからも……\nみんなの心を、包み込んでくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（两人成长茁壮的心，今后也会……\n温暖大家的心吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
